  nonce: '7e45'  # 7e45
  message: "WORK DONE (decontend run 10032026, stage 8) on local branch jgstern-agent/fix/hilum, commits 179d46a25f (core overload_arity) + cbecfb65ae (cpp). Not pushed; integrator merges.\n\nMechanism: every cpp definition records meta[\"parameters\"] (ADR-0058 home; defaults from a separate prototype merged at registration); the name's pick is re-chosen among its same-named definitions by the call's argument count via hypergumbo_core.overload_arity (own file first, run-wide second). Several admitting = ambiguous record (resolution_quality=\"ambiguous\", conf x 1/sqrt(N)) except #if alternatives with one signature; none admitting = the name's pick stands. Not re-chosen: a non-callable pick (struct), and an explicit-receiver member call other than this-> (pimpl: the arity match there IS the caller -- 13 sites measured before the guard).\n\nFiled instance, live repro (reduced fixture of keyword-spotter-transducer-impl.h): dev draws InitKeywords@12 -> InitKeywords@12 (self) at the sibling call; branch draws -> InitKeywords(std::istream&)@5. On sherpa-onnx d7526c8 frozen copy: L300 and L314 (and the rknn twins L239/L253) no longer self-calls. L336 (inside the TEMPLATE InitKeywords(Manager*)) is STILL a self-call: WI-rugin names that member template unqualified, so it is not in the class's overload set.\n\nMeasured by call site (sherpa-onnx): 372 sites moved (20/20 sampled reach the right definition or an ambiguous set holding it), 185 same target now stamped ambiguous, self-call sites 998 -> 990 (9 false ones gone, 1 true recursion IsByteBPE added). 959 of the remaining 990 self-call sites are explicit-receiver member calls (pimpl impl_->X) -- a separate mechanism, filed as its own item.\n\nTests: test_cpp_overload_arity.py (11), test_overload_arity.py (core); board smart-test 13352 passed, 0 failed, 100% coverage on changed files.\nResiduals filed: WI-lamij-bafur-kutid-furut-kisob-lijap-muzod-majup (explicit-receiver/pimpl self-calls, P2), WI-jutur-tonul-buloj-toson-mijum-jozot-havok-pipih (same-arity overloads: argument shapes; field-chain path, P3). Note posted on WI-rugin (member-template naming hides L319 from the overload set)."  # 7e45
